&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;When you apply to a job on this site, the personal data contained in your application will be collected by CoreWeave UK Ltd. (“Controller”), which is located at&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Phosphor (6th Floor), 133 Park Street, London, SE1 9EA&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;and can be contacted by emailing ----- Controller’s data protection officer can be contacted at ----- Your personal data will be processed for the purposes of managing Controller’s recruitment related activities, which include setting up and conducting interviews and tests for applicants, evaluating and assessing the results thereto, and as is otherwise needed in the recruitment and hiring processes. Such processing is legally permissible under Art. 6(1)(f) of (i) Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (General Data Protection Regulation (“GDPR”) and (ii) the GDPR as it forms part of the laws of the UK (“UK GDPR”), as necessary for the purposes of the legitimate interests pursued by the Controller, which are the solicitation, evaluation, and selection of applicants for employment. Your personal data will be shared with Greenhouse Software, Inc., a cloud services provider located in the United States of America and engaged by Controller to help manage its recruitment and hiring process on Controller’s behalf. With respect to transfers originating from the UK or the European Economic Area (&quot;EEA&quot;) to a country outside the UK or the EEA, we implement the appropriate transfer mechanism(s) and other appropriate solutions to address cross-border transfers as required by applicable law. You may request a copy of the suitable mechanisms we have in place by contacting us at &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a ----------
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Your personal data will be retained by Controller as long as Controller determines it is necessary to evaluate your application for employment. Where permitted by applicable law, we may also retain your personal data for a limited period after the recruitment process ends in order to consider you for future job opportunities, respond to legal claims, or comply with record-keeping obligations. Under the GDPR and the UK GDPR, you have the right to request access to your personal data, to request that your personal data be rectified or erased, and to request that processing of your personal data be restricted. You also have the right to data portability. In addition, you may lodge a complaint with the relevant supervisory authority: (i) A list of Europe’s data protection authorities can be found &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ec.europa.eu/justice/article-29/structure/data-protection-authorities/index_en.htm__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9xVQGfFw$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;; and (ii) for the UK, this is the &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://urldefense.com/v3/__https://ico.org.uk/__;!!I6uDfDBXfA!zaqvpaXitCAqve4cpmPGknjMlTsgIw8w_6xTVeiRpNP5Eo6Ajz9ZkXAYM2uL-nlD8kD6Ndd-Oe-k_BEQQh9IDhJOUA$&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Information Commissioner&#39;s Office&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;For additional information, please see our &lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.coreweave.com/docs/policies/terms-of-service/privacy-policy&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Why Verifone&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For more than 30 years Verifone has established a remarkable record of leadership in the electronic payment technology industry. Verifone has one of the leading electronic payment solutions brands and is one of the largest providers of electronic payment systems worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone has a diverse, dynamic and fast paced work environment in which employees are focused on results and have opportunities to excel. We take pride in the fact that we work with leading retailers, merchants, banks, and third party partners to invent and deliver innovative payments solution around the world. We strive for excellence in our products and services, and are obsessed with customer happiness. Across the globe, Verifone employees are leading the payments industry through experience, innovation, and an ambitious spirit. Whether it’s developing the next platform of secure payment systems or searching for new ways to bring electronic payments to new markets, the team at Verifone is dedicated to the success of our customers, partners and investors. It is this passion for innovation that drives each one of our employees for personal and professional success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Verifone is proudly an in-office work culture as we see immense benefits to career development and business results from our colleagues being physically co-located.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;What&#39;s Exciting About the Role&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking a Senior Paralegal based in London to play a key role in supporting Verifone&#39;s international legal function. The successful candidate will manage corporate entity governance activities across multiple jurisdictions, assist with commercial contract review and administration, support regulatory and compliance initiatives, and serve as a trusted resource for lawyers and business stakeholders.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a hands-on role requiring strong organizational skills, sound judgment, attention to detail, and the ability to work independently in a fast-paced global environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Skills&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate will be able to:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage the day-to-day administration of Verifone&#39;s global portfolio of legal entities, with a focus on EMEA entities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate annual corporate maintenance requirements, including director and officer appointments, board and shareholder approvals, statutory filings, powers of attorney, and corporate recordkeeping.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Liaise with corporate secretarial service providers and internal stakeholders regarding governance matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain corporate records, minute books, organizational charts, and entity management databases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support legal entity formations, restructurings, mergers, liquidations, and other corporate transactions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review, draft, and negotiate routine commercial agreements under attorney supervision, including:
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Non-disclosure agreements (NDAs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vendor agreements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Customer forms and standard commercial contracts&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Amendments, renewals, and statements of work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support implementation and administration of contract lifecycle management processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate legal requests and inquiries from internal business partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process improvements that enhance the efficiency and effectiveness of the legal function.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Required Experience and Qualifications&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A successful candidate will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Minimum of 10 years of paralegal, corporate governance, legal operations, or related legal experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience supporting corporate entities across multiple jurisdictions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong familiarity with corporate governance requirements and entity management practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience reviewing and administering NDAs and other routine commercial agreements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent organizational and project management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to manage multiple priorities and deadlines with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and commitment to accuracy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency with AI tools, Microsoft Office applications, and legal technology tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working in a multinational or international company with operations across Europe and other regions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: #236fa1;&quot;&gt;Our Commitment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Verifone is committed to creating a diverse environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, color, religion, gender, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, national origin, genetics, disability, age, or veteran status. Verifone is also committed to compliance with all fair employment practices regarding citizenship and immigration status.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.co.uk/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3 id=&quot;isPasted&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Company Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Metrea delivers effects-as-a-service to national security partners across five domains and more than a dozen mission areas. These include airborne ISR, electronic warfare, secure communications, aerial refueling, special air missions, aerial firefighting, and advanced simulation. We own the whole stack: designing, building, and operating turnkey capabilities that give our partners decisive, asymmetric advantage against rapidly evolving threats.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our operating model is built around three interlocking pillars. The Support Groups provide a global shared-service – spanning people, finance, platform, operations, legal, and engagement. This frees up our Core Groups, who develop and own mission capabilities end-to-end, to focus entirely on delivery. The Market Groups apply a regional lens, ensuring that our agile and adaptable capabilities remain aligned to the wicked problems that matter most to our partners across the Americas, EMEA, and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At the heart of our model is a simple but powerful idea: be a true partner with skin in the game. Our partners need effects, not just equipment. By owning the full stack – from the lab to the field – we are able to drive a continuous cycle of innovation that keeps our partners ahead. It&#39;s a fast-moving, intellectually demanding environment where talented people are given real responsibility, work on problems that matter, and contribute to an enterprise that is growing quickly and deliberately.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Headquartered in Washington, DC, with facilities across the United States, the United Kingdom, as well as Continental Europe and Asia-Pacific.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Group Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role sits within Platform Group area of Metrea. The Platform Group&amp;nbsp;rovides the Information Technology and Information Systems ecosystem that Metrea is utilising for the day-to-day operations, communication, collaboration and information sharing across its Platform business block.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Summary&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In this role, you will lead the design and operation of secure, reliable Azure platforms that enable Metrea&#39;s UK teams to build, deploy, and support mission-focused services with confidence. You will shape how we use Azure, Azure DevOps, GitHub, automation, and DevSecOps practices to improve delivery speed, platform resilience, and developer experience.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will be successful if you can combine hands-on engineering depth with technical leadership: solving complex platform challenges, mentoring others, and making pragmatic decisions for sensitive defence environments.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You&#39;ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, implement and operate secure, scalable Azure platform services, primarily supporting MITO programmes and UK engineering teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Architect Azure infrastructure through code, covering networking, identity, compute, storage, monitoring, governance and container platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and improve Azure DevOps and GitHub CI/CD pipelines for repeatable, controlled and secure software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop secure deployment patterns for AI-assisted and agentic workflows, including model integrations, automated evaluation and controlled releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploy and secure AI platform components such as model APIs, LLM workloads and MCP servers, with appropriate access controls, secrets management and data boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build and optimise containerised workloads using Docker and AKS, with resilient and repeatable deployment patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Implement DevSecOps practices including policy as code, vulnerability management, secrets management and software supply-chain controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish effective monitoring, logging, alerting and service-health reporting across platforms and workloads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Troubleshoot complex infrastructure, networking, identity, security, pipeline and production issues affecting business-critical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise and mentor engineers, promote effective platform practices and help teams adopt reusable, self-service tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience in a senior DevOps, platform, cloud or infrastructure engineering role supporting business-critical services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong hands-on experience designing, deploying and operating Microsoft Azure environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep experience with Azure DevOps or GitHub, including CI/CD pipelines, release controls and deployment automation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven infrastructure-as-code experience using Terraform, Bicep, ARM templates or comparable technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong knowledge of Docker, Kubernetes and AKS, including resilient and automated deployment patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience implementing DevSecOps controls across infrastructure, pipelines and the software supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building AI-assisted or agentic development workflows, with exposure to model APIs, LLM deployments or MCP.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong troubleshooting capability across cloud infrastructure, networking, identity, observability and software delivery.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to influence technical direction, mentor engineers and work effectively across software, platform, security and support teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Desirable Experience&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deploying or operating locally hosted LLMs or GPU-based model-serving infrastructure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Securing MCP servers, agent permissions and access to sensitive tools or data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backstage or another internal developer platform, including reusable templates and self-service workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in defence, government or another regulated environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Additional&amp;nbsp;Eligibility&amp;nbsp;Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The successful candidate must be able to qualify for UK Security Clearance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Private Medical Insurance   &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
